{"base_path":"/","components":null,"consumes":"[\"application/json;charset=UTF-8\",\"application/json\"]","definitions":{"AuthGrantRequest":{"example":{"is_reset":false},"properties":{"is_reset":{"description":"**参数解释**:是否重置授权。\n**约束限制**:不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n- true:重置已有委托(先删除再创建)。\n- false:普通授权。\n**默认取值**:false。","type":"boolean"}},"type":"object"},"AuthGrantResponse":{"example":{"service_name":"ModelArts","status":true},"properties":{"service_name":{"description":"**参数解释**:服务名称。\n**取值范围**:不涉及。","maxLength":64,"minLength":0,"type":"string"},"status":{"description":"**参数解释**:授权状态,true表示已授权,false表示未授权。\n**取值范围**:\n- true:已授权。\n- false:未授权。","type":"boolean"}},"required":["service_name","status"],"type":"object"},"ErrorRsp":{"description":"失败时返回的错误对象","properties":{"error_code":{"description":"错误码","maxLength":36,"minLength":8,"type":"string"},"error_msg":{"description":"错误描述","maxLength":512,"minLength":2,"type":"string"}},"required":["error_code","error_msg"]}},"description":null,"group_id":"ade740e866904a7dbdaa5ec0f538d4d0","host":"modelarts.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com","id":"fd8d082cd22c4b32b1be701f786b0b54","info_version":"v1","method":"post","name":"CreateAuthGrant","parameters":{},"paths":{"/v2/{project_id}/auth/grant":{"post":{"consumes":["application/json"],"description":"一键授权或重置授权接口用于一键创建ModelArts委托授权或重置已有委托。该接口适用于以下场景:当用户首次使用ModelArts服务需要开通委托授权时,或当现有委托授权出现异常、过期需要重新配置时,可通过此接口一键完成授权操作。使用该接口的前提条件是用户已登录系统且具有相应的操作权限。执行一键授权后,系统将自动创建委托授权关系;执行重置操作后,原有委托将被替换为新的授权。若用户无权限操作或服务异常,接口将返回相应的错误信息。","operationId":"CreateAuthGrant","parameters":[{"description":"**参数解释**:用户项目ID,获取方法请参见[获取项目ID和名称](modelarts_03_0147.xml)。\n**约束限制**:不涉及。\n**取值范围**:不涉及。\n**默认取值**:不涉及。","in":"path","name":"project_id","required":true,"type":"string"},{"description":"授权请求体。","in":"body","name":"CreateAuthGrantRequestBody","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/AuthGrantRequest"}}],"produces":["application/json"],"responses":{"200":{"description":"委托授权成功响应。","examples":{"application/json":{"service_name":"ModelArts","status":true}},"schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/AuthGrantResponse"}},"400":{"description":"Error response","schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/ErrorRsp"}},"403":{"description":"委托已存在但无法查询,需手动删除。","schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/ErrorRsp"}}},"summary":"一键授权或重置授权","tags":["授权管理"],"x-api-type":"open-api","x-is-registered":"N","x-open-region-cloud":"hc,hcs,fcs,hws,hws_hk,hk","x-publish-doc":"Y","x-support-sdk":"Y"}}},"product_short":"ModelArts","region_id":"cn-north-4","schemes":["HTTPS"],"security_definitions":{"ApiTokenAuth":{"in":"header","name":"X-Auth-Token","type":"apiKey"}},"summary":"一键授权或重置授权","tags":"授权管理","uri":null,"version":"2.0"}